flowchart TD
    V[View<br/>Swing forms and drafts<br/>FlatLaf styles] --> C[Controller<br/>listeners + SwingWorker<br/>EDT/background boundary]
    C --> S[Service<br/>use-case + validation<br/>business transaction boundary]
    S --> D[Domain<br/>9 entities, enums, calculators]
    S --> R[Repository interfaces<br/>query/persist contracts]
    S --> T[TransactionRunner<br/>technical boundary]
    S --> STR[DiagnosticStrategy<br/>policy interface]
    T -. implements .-> JT[JpaTransactionRunner<br/>one EntityManager / operation]
    JT --> P[JPA repository implementations<br/>shared EntityManager]
    P -. implements .-> R
    P --> D
    JT --> I[JPA / Hibernate / JDBC infrastructure]
    P --> I
    I --> DB[(Azure SQL Database<br/>dbo target schema)]
